    /Helvetica-Bold findfont 70 scalefont setfont
    85 420 moveto
    (F) show
    /Helvetica findfont 150 scalefont setfont
    0 0 0 setrgbcolor
    280 70 moveto show
    /Helvetica-Bold findfont 150 scalefont setfont
    0 0.690 0 setrgbcolor
    90 70 moveto show
